    "type": "question",
    "label": "12",
    "prompt": "Simplify $\\log_2\\left(\\frac{8}{75}\\right)-2\\log_2\\left(\\frac{3}{5}\\right)-4\\log_2\\left(\\frac{3}{2}\\right)$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$7-7\\log_2 3$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\log_2\\left(\\frac{8}{75}\\right)-2\\log_2\\left(\\frac35\\right)-4\\log_2\\left(\\frac32\\right)&=\\log_2\\left(\\frac{8/75}{(3/5)^2(3/2)^4}\\right)\\\\\\log_2\\left(\\frac{8}{75}\\right)-2\\log_2\\left(\\frac35\\right)-4\\log_2\\left(\\frac32\\right)&=\\log_2\\left(\\frac8{75}\\times\\frac{25}{9}\\times\\frac{16}{81}\\right)\\\\\\log_2\\left(\\frac{8}{75}\\right)-2\\log_2\\left(\\frac35\\right)-4\\log_2\\left(\\frac32\\right)&=\\log_2\\left(\\frac{128}{2187}\\right)\\\\\\log_2\\left(\\frac{8}{75}\\right)-2\\log_2\\left(\\frac35\\right)-4\\log_2\\left(\\frac32\\right)&=7\\log_2 2-7\\log_2 3\\\\\\log_2\\left(\\frac{8}{75}\\right)-2\\log_2\\left(\\frac35\\right)-4\\log_2\\left(\\frac32\\right)&=7-7\\log_2 3\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
